        <key>construction</key>
        <string>Retain the actual case-specific native Z or stroked-Z body and join the same-cut Cyrillic lower return curve below the baseline. This creates the historical returning hook, not a modern Ze/Dze whole-glyph alias. No glyph scaling or synthetic italic.</string>
